The plate is a square-ish dish, roughly 26 cm across in the frame. The food mound covers about 300 px by 350 px of a plate about 900 px wide, so it is roughly 9 cm by 10 cm and about 3 cm high. That gives a volume of around 200 ml. Flaked tuna is fairly dense, so I estimate the whole mound at about 150 g.

The mound is mostly tuna, perhaps 120 g. The remainder is celery (about 12 g), red onion (about 7 g), carrot (about 5 g) and possibly a little avocado or dressing. The mixture looks lightly bound, so I'm adding a small amount of mayo or dressing at about 10 g.

